# Workflow map
Column text and gates live in `playbook-epic.mdc` and `playbook-feature.mdc`. This file names types and columns. It does not number them.

## Vocabulary
- A **stage** is a board column. Briefs and rules use the column name. Do not call a column a step number.
- «Решения» is the decision log when a question is open. It is not a column. An empty «Выбрано» on a row for this slice blocks Разработка (`playbook-feature.mdc`).
- The issue label `статус:*` is the source of truth for the stage (`project-github-formats.mdc` «Board statuses»). The wiki page holds section text only. Do not require a status line on the wiki. A template may omit it, or say that the stage is the issue status.
- There is no second, coarser status scale.

## Types
Two artifact types. A column is not a type. There is no subtask and no mini-feature.

| Type | What | Artifact | Route |
|---|---|---|---|
| Epic | business goal, including the standing bugs epic | wiki `Epic-<Name>` + parent issue (`тип: родительская`, field «Тип» = «Эпик») | `playbook-epic.mdc` |
| Feature | demonstrable result, including a small feature and a bug-feature | wiki `Feature-<Name>` + issue; links its epic | `playbook-feature.mdc` |

- Roadmap (wiki `Plan-`) orders epics. It is not a task type. An epic is born from that roadmap or from an owner ask (`playbook-epic.mdc`).
- Features under one epic may run in parallel (`project-travelagency.mdc` «Parallel work»). Each feature moves that epic's problem. It is not a side quest.
- `<Name>`: Latin, English, Title-Case-With-Hyphens. Do not rename it casually.
- Closed work: no new docs.
- GitHub parent and child issues stay for board control. Children of an epic are features, including bug-features. Do not name another child type.

### Bug-feature, tiny fix, standing bugs
A bug-feature uses the same columns and the same wiki sections as a Feature. Label `bug`. In «Связи», link the feature that spawned it and the parent epic. Open a separate bug-feature only when the fix is substantial: add or remove a field, change a screen, or change a business rule.

A typo, or a 500 caused by a typo, inside an open feature: fix that feature in place. No new issue.

An unrelated bug found while an epic is in flight goes under the standing bugs epic, not under the current product epic. Same feature route, label `bug`. It must not stop finishing the current epic. The standing bugs epic holds only unrelated discoveries. It is an ordinary epic: short text, same epic columns.

Finish the current product epic, including bug-features spawned by its features, before moving to the next roadmap epic (`playbook-epic.mdc` «Epic pick»). Dependabot and other non-product issues already in flight are not that next epic.

## Columns
One `статус:*` label on the issue. That label is the stage. `board-sync.yml` copies it to the Projects Status column. Wiki sections show the artifact. They are not a second status.

Hard gate: move to the next column only when the previous stage's artifacts are filled and visible (wiki section, test cases, or PR, as that stage requires). No skipping.

### Epic
Очередь → Бизнес-анализ → Архитектура → Разбиение → В работе (child features in flight) → На ревью (owner epic acceptance) → Готово.

What each column contains, the gate, owner acceptance, and how the next epic is chosen: `playbook-epic.mdc`.

Удержание is an extra column. It is not part of that sequence.

### Feature
Очередь → Аналитика → Архитектура → Тест-кейсы → Разработка → Приёмка → Готово.

The full specification bar, review inside Разработка, acceptance, and `Doc-`: `playbook-feature.mdc`.

На ревью is an interrupt when the owner must decide. It is not a review column and not the next stage after Тест-кейсы. Удержание is an extra column.

Code review, CI, and Cursor Automations stay inside Разработка. After merge, when Deploy to dev is green, set Приёмка.

### На ревью and Удержание
- На ревью: only while the owner must decide, and for owner epic acceptance after every child is Готово. The comment records which column to restore. After the answer, restore that column. Do not restore a feature to В работе. В работе is the epic column for children in flight.
- Удержание: the issue is paused. Label `статус: удержание`. It is not in Очередь.

### Outside the product routes
Process docs, infra, and questions are not a third type and do not get a fake feature page. They still have exactly one `статус:*`. Use Очередь, Разработка while a change is in a PR, Приёмка when dev acceptance applies, Готово when done, and На ревью when the owner must decide. Dependabot has no issue. Do not use this shorter list for a product feature or a bug-feature.

