## Common
- Issue = control panel (the status label plus the page link). Artifacts live on the wiki, not in chat.
- Fill only the section for the current column. A disagreement goes to «Решения».
- Page headings match the column. Epic: «Бизнес-анализ», «Архитектура», «Разбиение», and «Решения» when a question is open. Feature: «Аналитика», «Архитектура», «Тест-кейсы», and «Решения» when a question is open. An older heading «Бизнес и сценарии» is that analysis section until the page is edited. No child analysis page. Templates live on the wiki (`Epic-Template`, `Feature-Template`). Do not copy them into the repo. A template that still names a subtask, a mini-feature, or a status line as the source of truth is stale: follow this map.
- `Doc-` describes what works in `main`. The PR names the page, or «вики не затронута». The wiki text is written after merge (`playbook-feature.mdc`). Merge does not wait for that edit, and the page is not written before `main`.
- Normative and product documentation: `.cursor/`, `AGENTS.md`, and the GitHub wiki only. No repo `docs/` tree. No `skills-lock.json` or third-party skill packs in this repo.
- Process gap: fix the live artifacts and the rules in the same delivery. Scan rules, templates, automations, and board-sync together.
